{# ============================================================
   EXHIBIT NHBE-b  |  Defence Case File
   ============================================================ #}

{% set gridded = "<strong>NHBE-b-gridded</strong>" %}

<div class="exhibit-wrapper">

  {# ── EXHIBIT HEADER ─────────────────────────────────────── #}
  {{ exhibit_header([
      [["Exhibit Reference", "NHBE-b"],       ["Associated Gridded Reference", "NHBE-b-gridded"]],
      [["Subject Property",  FF],             ["Claimant / Neighbouring Holding", FFH]],
  ]) }}

  {# ── IMAGE OVERVIEW ─────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <div class="section">
    <h3>Image Overview</h3>

    {{ rotate_90 }}

    <p>
      The exhibit is taken from a similar or the same position as Exhibit NHBE-a,
      however the focus is instead in a more south-south-easterly direction down
      the right of way enjoyed by {{ FFH }}, which forms the main access to the property.
    </p>
    <p>
      The image does not appear to highlight any significant features that were not
      present in NHBE-a; however it does show that the items described in NHBE-a
      are not infringing upon the track and do not restrict its access in such a
      way as to cause a nuisance.
    </p>
    <p>
      For clarity, grid references as displayed on {{gridded}} may be used
      when identifying the items described below.
    </p>
  </div>

  {# ── EXHIBIT ITEMS ───────────────────────────────────────── #}
  <div class="exhibit-items-row">

    {# ── ITEM 1 — CONDITION AND DIMENSIONS OF THE RIGHT OF WAY ─ #}
    <div class="section exhibit-item">
      <h3>Item 1 &mdash; Condition and Dimensions of the Right of Way</h3>

      <table class="item-meta" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3" border="1">
        <tr>
          <td width="30%"><strong>Grid Reference ({{gridded}})</strong></td>
          <td><i>Full extent of image</i></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Location in Image</strong></td>
          <td>The full width and extent of the access track as visible along its south-south-easterly axis</td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <table class="item-section">
        <tr><th>Description</th></tr>
        <tr><td>
          <p>
            Annual hedge growth subsequent to the breeding season on the edge of the
            track is visible on the right of way; however, gauging an exact width of
            the accessible path is difficult from the image.
          </p>
        </td></tr>
      </table>

      <table class="item-section">
        <tr><th>Defence Response to Claims Made</th></tr>
        <tr><td>
          <ol type="i">
            <li>
              The width of the track is not obstructed in any way.
            </li>
            <li>
              The surface and condition of the farm access track is consistent with
              its functional character and performance requirement.
            </li>
            <li>
              The width of the track is at all times wider than each narrow constrained
              section of access track west of {{ FF }} over which {{ FFHO }} passes
              to reach {{ FFH }}.
            </li>
            <li>
              There are no other discernible elements in Exhibit NHBE-b that could
              found a claim of nuisance.
            </li>
          </ol>
        </td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>

  </div>{# ── end exhibit-items-row ───────────────────────────── #}

</div>
